    (Day (`s 637(1) the last day for the notice` `the date the rights attached to the shares were varied`)) MINUS (Day `the date the rights attached to the shares were varied`)

-- src:8504 | (1) Where the rights attached to any shares of a company are varied, the company must within one month from the date on which the variation is made deliver to the registrar a notice giving particulars of the variation.
@ref s 637(1) Notice of particulars of variation of rights attached to shares: in time (src:8504)
GIVEN `the date the rights attached to the shares were varied` IS A DATE
      `the date the company delivered the notice to the registrar, if it has` IS A MAYBE DATE
